## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
- N/A for this phase, manual verification of the API endpoints will be used.

### Manual Verification
1. Submit an application as an Under Graduate Student; verify it lands in the Dean's dashboard.
2. Log in as Dean, verify the dashboard loads, and approve the UG application.
3. Log in as CC Admin, open the approved application, edit the details, and click "Reject". Verify the application goes to `REJECTED_CC` status.
4. Test provisioning another user and verify that the auto-generated email format matches the policy rules (e.g., `name.department.2025@bhu.ac.in`).
5. Provision a user and manually override the username field to test conflict resolution.
